<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s266S"><span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s266q1">At this point</span>, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w4">glass</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w5">full of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w1">wet</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p1">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w2">flowing</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w3">water</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w9">is</span> something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w8">with</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w7">three different</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w6">parts</span>. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p2">Nonetheless</span>, it <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w13">is</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p3">not</span> the case that <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w10">all three</span> different beings <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w12">see</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w11">all three</span> parts. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w14">craving spirit</span> is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w18">forced by</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w16">bad</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w15">karma</span> he has <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w17">collected</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w20">see</span> the glass of water <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p4">as</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w19"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s266m1">pus</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s266m2">blood</span></span>; <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p6">and</span> he does<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s266p5">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w24">see</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w22">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s266w23">two</span> <span class="u" da